            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Authours wish to do a personal contribution to the anginosis syndromes. We have a series of fifty-two cases divided in various syndromes. We have, then, examined the possible factors of coronary risk, such as arterious hypertension, smoke, diabetes, hypercholesterolaemia.</AbstractText>
